00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:50.260
you might your dream of being in Iceland and
you know you know how you're having a fight

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.260
with.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.030
Ice beer or something, you know, like with
a.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:57.650
So so certainly environment, your physiology
and all that influences your dream in that

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:58.650
way.

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:06.060
Speaker 1: There are so many academic texts
