00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.330
So that's one thing.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.040
The light issue is a huge thing.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.720
Avoid bright light late in the night.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:20.540
I mean, we know this, but it's very important
