Another, you know, just element to this is
that also the whole idea of a siesta time

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.160
and sleeping.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:57.130
During that time, and it seems also there
might be a biological advantage of doing that,

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:01.600
the fact that you will feel tired by noon
and sleeping for those hours could potentially

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:04.920
help and even napping can be very, very refreshing.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.540
And, you know, sometimes you can compensate
